PROJECT NAME: Phishing Awareness Portal

PROJECT DESCRIPTION:

The Phishing Awareness Portal is a cybersecurity-focused project designed to educate and raise awareness among users about phishing attacks and related online security threats.

The portal aims to help users understand common phishing techniques, identify suspicious emails, messages, links, and websites, and adopt safe cybersecurity practices. It provides awareness-based information and guidance to reduce the risk of users falling victim to phishing attacks.

The project focuses on improving cybersecurity awareness through an easy-to-understand and user-friendly platform. It also emphasizes the importance of recognizing social engineering techniques, verifying suspicious communications, protecting sensitive information, and following secure online practices.

The overall objective of the project is to create an effective awareness platform that helps users recognize phishing attempts and make safer decisions while using digital services.